<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθο-στάτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽἵστημἰ</span>”
				<i>upright shaft, pillar,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1134
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				980
			</span></i> ; <i>building stones laid with their longest edges
				vertical,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.372.60
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				22.1668.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				42(1).103.74
			</span></i>, al.; <i>upright beam,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				74.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				162.14
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλιμάκων ὀρθοστάτας</span>
			prob. cj. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				497
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>funeral monument with pillars,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mitt.
				24.235
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thyatira</span>); so perh. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				547
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a sort of
			sacrificial bread, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.73
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			=
			<i>librarius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
